OL,3,A'I'd rather die than ring the police':
OL,4,ADistrust and fear in Middlesbrough
OL,5,Aafter A66 crash
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is just after 8pm in Grangetown,
OL,8,FMiddlesbrough, and the light is fading.
OL,10,FTwo teenagers in balaclavas tear across
OL,11,Fa park on a muddy red quad bike,
OL,12,Fpulling wheelies as they pass a man
OL,13,Fwalking his dog.
OL,15,FYounger boys, some not yet in their
OL,16,Fteens, gather excitedly around the
OL,17,Fbike.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/41
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
