OL,3,AReform UK won't be distracted by
OL,4,A'campaign of attacks', Farage tells
OL,5,Aparty conference
OL,6,
OL,7,FNigel Farage has just addressed Reform
OL,8,FUK members at the party's conference in
OL,9,FBirmingham
OL,11,FHe says the party won't be deterred by
OL,12,Fwhat he calls a "campaign of attacks"
OL,13,Fagainst it
OL,15,FIt comes as Farage says his party has
OL,16,F"done nothing wrong" and "taken no
OL,17,Fillegal money" following the release of
OL,18,Fa Channel 4 News report
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/41
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
