OL,3,AReform UK won't be distracted by
OL,4,A'campaign of attacks', Farage tells
OL,5,Aparty conference
OL,6,
OL,7,FUndercover filming by Verbatim
OL,8,FInvestigations shows Farage's senior
OL,9,Faide Dan Jukes appears to suggest a way
OL,10,Fto evade electoral law to secure a
OL,11,Fforeign donation of #500,000 for Reform
OL,13,FThe Channel 4 News report has dominated
OL,14,Fheadlines - Farage tells the BBC that
OL,15,F"obviously it's not what you want on
OL,16,Fthe day of the conference"
OL,18,FJukes and Reform's head of policy James
OL,19,FOrr have since stepped down and the
OL,20,Fparty says it's launching an internal
OL,21,Finvestigation
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/41
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
