OL,3,AFarage unveils small boats deal with
OL,4,AFrench National Rally party
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigel Farage has agreed a deal with
OL,7,FFrance's hard-right National Rally (RN)
OL,8,Fparty on returning migrants who attempt
OL,9,Fto cross the English Channel in small
OL,10,Fboats, should both parties win power.
OL,12,FIt comes after Reform UK last month
OL,13,Fannounced a plan to intercept boats and
OL,14,Freturn migrants to French ports using
OL,15,Fthe Royal Navy.
OL,17,FThe proposed agreement with RN states
OL,18,Fthat France would "ordinarily accept"
OL,19,Fthose on board, and then repatriate
OL,20,Fthem to their home country.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/41
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
