OL,3,ARussia hits Ukrainian security
OL,4,Aheadquarters in drone attack, Zelensky
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,F"The drone was aimed directly at the
OL,8,Foffice of the Head of the Security
OL,9,FService in that building," Zelensky
OL,10,Fconfirmed. It suggests Russia's new
OL,11,Fdrones are growing in accuracy and
OL,12,Fsignals Moscow could step up strikes
OL,13,Fbefore possible US mediation talks this
OL,14,Fweekend.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG16/41
